OL,3,ALargest attack on Moscow sees Ukraine
OL,4,Afire hundreds of drones, mayor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine has fired its largest drone
OL,7,Fattack on the Moscow region, the mayor
OL,8,Fhas said, hitting the city's main oil
OL,9,Frefinery and a residential building.
OL,11,FMayor Sergei Sobyanin said 450 drones
OL,12,Fheading for the capital had been shot
OL,13,Fdown in what he called "the most
OL,14,Fmassive" attack. The region's governor
OL,15,Fsaid at least two people were killed
OL,16,Fand 20 injured.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
