OL,3,ALargest attack on Moscow sees Ukraine
OL,4,Afire hundreds of drones, mayor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine's President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,7,Fconfirmed Kyiv had hit a "key" Russian
OL,8,Foil facility and a logistics site in
OL,9,Fthe region with drones and missiles,
OL,10,Frepresenting "billions of dollars that
OL,11,Fsustain the war machine".
OL,13,FUkrainian officials meanwhile said nine
OL,14,Fpeople, including three children, had
OL,15,Fbeen killed in Russian attacks in the
OL,16,FKyiv and Sumy regions on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
