OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AEd Sheeran admits 'mistakes' at first
OL,4,Ashow since Macklemore controversy
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I never wanted to be an activist
OL,7,Fmusician, but this has put me in the
OL,8,Fmiddle of an important and passionate
OL,9,Fargument about free speech and the most
OL,10,Fcomplex political issue on the planet,"
OL,11,FSheeran said.
OL,13,FHe described the 7 October 2023
OL,14,FHamas-led attacks as "horrific" and
OL,15,Fcalled the situation in Gaza
OL,16,F"unjustifiable".
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
