OL,3,ATrump says triumphal arch will be
OL,4,Amilitary complex with drones and
OL,5,Asnipers
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has said his
OL,8,Fproposed triumphal arch will double as
OL,9,Fa complex to store military equipment,
OL,10,Fcomplete with the ability to deploy
OL,11,Fsnipers and drones.
OL,13,FIn a Sunday morning post, Trump said he
OL,14,Fis updating the plans at the "strong
OL,15,Frequest" of the US military and for
OL,16,F"national security purposes".
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
